{"Hi, you’ve reached Ruth Calloway at WKRS.": [0.0, 4.608], "I can’t come to the phone. I’m on the air. I’m always on the air.": [5.008, 5.653], "If you’re calling about the fog, it isn’t going to lift. If you’re calling about the bells, don’t count them out loud.": [11.061, 10.176], "The station is at thirty three Harbor Road. Second floor. The light is always on.": [21.637, 8.256], "If it’s after three twelve, please don’t wait for the tone. Just hang up. And lock your door.": [30.293, 8.363], "Gull Point Light. Keeper speaking.": [39.056, 2.56], "The lamp’s been dark since the Hollowtide. I keep trying to light it.": [42.016, 4.544], "Something keeps knocking on the glass. I don’t answer it. I won’t answer it.": [46.96, 4.971], "If you can see the point from your window, don’t signal. They’ll see you.": [52.331, 4.416], "HollowVale Harbor Historical Society. Our hours are midnight to three twelve.": [57.147, 6.144], "The town was founded in eighteen oh three. It was emptied in twenty fifteen.": [63.691, 5.824], "For the history of the harbor, tune your radio to station forty nine.": [69.915, 4.949], "For information about the vault, please hold.": [75.264, 3.285], "The vault is not open to the public.": [78.949, 3.029]}